    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 08:27:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>No.36 今日主菜：热播韩剧《亲爱的X》，走近“恶女”，走进白雅珍被塑造的人生。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>哈喽~友友们，尝尝咸淡的招牌菜“韩剧轻解读”回归！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我想借由“白雅珍”这个角色，聊聊一个被贴上“反社会人格”标签的女性，为什么让那么多观众恨不起来？她究竟是“恶女”，还是被社会塑造的悲剧？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【友情提示】：本期含有大量剧透，如有介意，请在追剧后收听。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶咸淡时刻：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 白雅珍：恶女，还是系统下的创伤产物？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> 白雅珍与她的工具男人们：拯救者、追随者和那个像样的大人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> “烂尾”争议：开放式结局，破碎是万物之芽的缝隙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">24:14</a> &nbsp;为什么我们开始共情“恶女”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 千禧年的“蛇蝎美人”徐迎美</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶提及作品：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《爱上女主播/夏娃的诱惑》（2000）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Eyes On Me (Inst.)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Run &amp; Run-金艺琳</span></p><span></span><p><span>Insane (Inst.)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Devil's Angel-MINNIE</span></p>]]></description>
