    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Dec 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>No.35 今日甜点：聊聊近期热门恋综《换乘恋爱4》、《姐姐对我来说是女人啊》，以及展开讲讲近两年韩国恋综的视角变化</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh2h84LuQ8K09f__P2JNoxuFZlFc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>▶咸淡时刻：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 疯了几个月的追星女回归主播日常了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 《换乘恋爱4》：节目流程设计的小变化，X-room略显失望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 贤智（女5）的争议，制作组难辞其咎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 敏京（女2）&amp;有植（男4）：8年情侣，时间与情感的错位期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> &nbsp;允宁（女1）&amp;百贤（男1）、智贤（女4）&amp;元奎（男3），如何定义好的恋人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 超绝诡异画面:与Ex的Ex三人一起搭手加油？是冒犯还是开放性的探索？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 《姐姐对我来说是女人》武镇（男1）&amp;本熙（女4）：4199，谁能拒绝忠犬“小狗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a> 如何理解尚贤（男2）的“积极争取”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> 韩国恋综的变化：从撒糖走向社会切片</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶提及作品：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《最后的爱情》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《母胎单身恋爱大作战》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《恋爱兄妹》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《着了魔的恋爱》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《心脏配对》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《至爱的亲爱的》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Love on the canvas-SOHEE</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ruin My Life-BOYNEXTDOOR</span></p><span></span><p><span>해가 될까-SUN OR SUCK</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><span>尝尝咸淡已开通小红书听友群，欢迎订阅</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/982eP1vRQX6" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/982eP1vRQX6"><span>