  <item>
    <title>喜剧综艺抽象、梗难懂，我们的笑点能否再次相通？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ea3396224325ea70b42a7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ea3396224325ea70b42a7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Oct 2025 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>No.34 今日夜宵：聊聊喜剧综艺！快乐成为一门艰难的学问，怀念一下那个还能被同一件事逗笑的年代。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>喜剧综艺喜人奇妙夜第二季在国庆前开播，其中小品“技能五子棋”迅速在互联网上爆火，关于喜剧小品“可笑”还是“好笑”的讨论，再一次走入大众视野。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“技能五子棋是什么梗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“好抽象啊，这个为什么好笑，不懂啊”</span></p><span></span><p><span>……像极了香菜，有人疯狂上头，有人无语下头……</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为80后一代，见证过小品、综艺、影视等等泛娱乐文化作品的更迭换代，我们如何看待喜剧发展的这些年呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶聊天的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播李诺：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/618b8cf599d43ad7d3d848bb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/618b8cf599d43ad7d3d848bb"><span>太男了</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/664c20969ff0e17714bffc02" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/664c20969ff0e17714bffc02"><span>在读Book turner</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669a81d08fcadceb908bfe03" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669a81d08fcadceb908bfe03"><span>不花钱唠嗑</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/633fc05c9186d4e4c46a0bdb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/633fc05c9186d4e4c46a0bdb"><span>结婚之后</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6225685e6560cf98ebfd8a69" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6225685e6560cf98ebfd8a69"><span>随想整理</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/689b061b51992d830c486003" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/689b061b51992d830c486003"><span>影像记忆</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6789b184b202ddddf780a9d6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6789b184b202ddddf780a9d6"><span>播客Yu我</span></a><span>|</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63f8078ca42b41bccb628b64" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63f8078ca42b41bccb628b64"><span>昨夜Spirit</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶Highlight</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>喜剧是一种很纯粹的娱乐。它不一定非要‘上价值’，我不想要那么复杂的东西，我就想要发疯一下。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>当代的很多观众，本质上已经离开了观众的坐席，而成为了一个消费者，一个点评者，甚至一个判官。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>喜剧是一种群体联结。它像一座桥梁告诉你：你不孤单，因为我也一样。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>喜剧跟悲剧的功效是一样的，它们会在那一瞬间撕开一个口子，让我看到生活的更多可能性。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>希望现在很多人去抱着一种又能怎么样的一种心态去生活，哪怕我这次创作出来的喜剧作品不好笑又能怎么样呢？我下一个可能会更好。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶咸淡时刻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 喜剧对当代牛马社畜的存在意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 喜剧节目形式的演变与网络时代影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 非学术性探讨：如何理解和看待现在的喜剧作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 喜剧创作者变懒惰了嘛？喜剧对话的对象究竟是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 近年代表性的喜剧综艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> 喜剧是否具备社会功能？取决于自我的需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 网络热梗大乱炖，快乐隔了一堵墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3271">54:31</a> 演员在创作中的自我剖析以及喜剧综艺存在的价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3804">01:03:24</a> 生活好苦哇！“哭唧唧”和“笑哈哈”能为我们做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4179">01:09:39</a> 关于喜剧作品未来的一点点暴言：极致肤浅&amp;纯粹表达？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4764">01:19:24</a> 观众与创作者：权利、义务与建设性反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▶BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Cute Circus-Tsundere Twintails</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>▶提及的影综作品</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一年一度喜剧大赛》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《喜人奇妙夜》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《喜剧大会》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《海边的曼彻斯特》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《演员请就位》</span></p>]]></description>
